## Phase 1 — Job Discovery

**Status: COMPLETE.** Verified live: 10 companies, 3,110 postings seen, 105 matched, 0 duplicates on re-run.

- [x] SQLAlchemy models: `Company`, `Job`, `ScrapeLog`
